title: 'Find why the Emacs diff-view integration test takes 42 s: probably two 20-second waits that time out every run.'
pid: 8708a388-cce4-4893-a72d-a5dbe7609fa6
body: |2-
  It calls its commit helper twice, and each call ends by waiting up to
  20 s for the client to go idle, ignoring a timeout. The same test on
  the Neovim client takes 2 s, and it took 42 s on both machines, so it
  is waiting, not working. That is a fifth of the suite.
